<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Translucent Body</ansi> mutation

Your flesh turns to glass — light slides through you, and at rest you
all but vanish.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Quicksilver Nerves and Corvid Brain

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  A blade swung at you finds mostly empty air, you fade near to
  invisibility when still, and your mind-magic strikes harder

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Your glassy flesh is fragile — it turns aside far less of any blow
  that does land

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
